  "id": "participative-leadership",
  "term": "participative leadership",
  "definition": "Participative leadership is a leadership approach that involves stakeholders or followers in organizational processes and the leader–follower dynamic. In this study context, it is described as positively linked with followers’ psychological safety and radical creativity.",
